doc_text:
today, my mother's appointment was canceled because she had a sore throat and the front desk told her "do not come in here! you have coronavirus!" they refused to see her. 

if they had bothered to look at her records, she had been at this exact office 4 months ago for the exact same throat problem. (i.e. not coronavirus) 

ignorant and unprofessional.  i would not recommend them.

i quit the gym at city creek yesterday because:
1) they were still open when restaurants, bars, and responsible businesses have temporarily closed in order not to spread the coronavirus;
2) i had to actually go down to city creek to suspend my membership;
3) they would have charged me $30/month - even if i suspended my membership.
for placing short-term cash-flow above long-term social responsibility, i give the gym at city creek one star.
